== a parameter expectation is checked at each application
digest: checks 2 (argument 2) deps 1 (alias 1) equalities 2 omissions 0
check argument A : S apply.ml:6:15-6:16
check argument B : S apply.ml:7:15-7:16
dep <S> -alias-> S
equal F(A) = FA
equal F(B) = FB
== the parameter of a functor type in a signature
