== inline and generative inclusions anchor at a site
digest: checks 5 (ascription 4 argument 1) deps 11 (definition 2 include 2 instance 3 interface 4) equalities 0 omissions 0
check ascription site.ml:4:30-4:77 : S site.ml:4:36-4:77
check ascription site.ml:5:12-5:60 : S2 site.ml:5:19-5:60
check ascription M : S.T@site(Site.ml#0) site.ml:8:15-8:38
check argument site.ml:6:11-6:34 : param(F.X)@site(Site.ml#1) site.ml:6:11-6:34
check ascription N : S2.U@site(Site.ml#2) site.ml:9:15-9:38
dep S.T -include-> S.T@site(Site.ml#0)
dep S -definition-> <#1>
dep S2.U -include-> S2.U@site(Site.ml#2)
dep S2 -definition-> <#2>
dep S.T@site(Site.ml#0) -instance-> S.T@body(S)
dep param(F.X)@site(Site.ml#1) -instance-> <param(F.X)>
dep S2.U@site(Site.ml#2) -instance-> S2.U@body(S2)
dep <#1> -interface-> S.T@body(S)
dep <#2> -interface-> S2.U@body(S2)
dep <M> -interface-> S.T@site(Site.ml#0)
dep <N> -interface-> S2.U@site(Site.ml#2)
